                      (ntation_runtime.s):00001         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract MENU_TICK profile=presentation: Dispatch fresh Attract and menu input during selected-screen loading and Attract runtime.
                      (ntation_runtime.s):00002         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_runtime_dispatch profile=presentation: Call the page-$24 menu updater for fresh input or pending Attract repaint work, restore PAR5 to $34, and return to the caller.
                      (ntation_runtime.s):00003         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract MENU_SCAN profile=input: Call the banked scanner, which may route a safe automatic-loop wake.
